               in ssllkk__iinniitt is 22 or 33) characters in length.  A empty string or
               a null pointer sets up a blank label.

       _a_l_i_g_n   is  00,  11,  or 22, aligning _l_a_b_e_l to the left, center, or right,
               respectively, within the 8 (5) character cells housing it.

       ssllkk__llaabbeell obtains the string assigned to label number _l_a_b_n_u_m, with  any
       leading and trailing blanks stripped.

