           parameter.

           Two of these new functions (unlike the SVr4 functions) have no pro‐
           vision for color: ssllkk__aattttrr__oonn and ssllkk__aattttrr__ooffff.

           The third function (ssllkk__aattttrr__sseett) has a color pair parameter.

       •   It added _c_o_n_s_t qualifiers to parameters (unnecessarily), and

       •   It added ssllkk__ccoolloorr.

