       •   The format codes 22 and 33 for ssllkk__iinniitt  were  added  by  _n_c_u_r_s_e_s  in
           1996.  PDCurses 2.4 added this feature in 2001.

       The function ssllkk__aattttrr was added by _n_c_u_r_s_e_s in 1996.

       X/Open  Curses  does  not  specify a limit for the number of colors and
